  "content": "<h3><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_16b240ec-1841-4a25-99c3-b053264b541d.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"848\" height=\"256\"></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>⚠️ 警告！！！ ⚠️</strong></h3>\n<p>该资源包仍在开发中，部分细节可能处理得不够完善。敬请谅解！😥</p>\n<h3><strong>🖊️ 资源包说明 🖊️</strong></h3>\n<p>本资源包将 CozyUI+ 的界面风格扩展到了更多模组，例如暮色森林、天界传说、东方小女仆等。</p>\n<p>请先下载 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcozyui-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI+</a>，并确保在加载此资源包时，将其排在 CozyUI+ 之上以正常工作。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/056a4161283b4fecdc1acc753e55921d14e69b6f.png\" alt=\"Load the CozmoUI pack above CozyUI+.\\\">\\ <strong>目前此资源包仅支持 Minecraft 1.20.1。</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>⭐ 已适配模组 ⭐</strong></h3>\n<table style=\"width:90.1003%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;width:40.5937%\">模组名称</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;width:18.1135%\">模组版本</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;width:23.2888%\">主页链接</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;width:17.9518%\">资源包版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:40.5937%\">Alex's Mobs</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:18.1135%\">1.22.9</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:23.2888%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🔗CurseForge</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:17.9518%\">v0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:40.5937%\">Maid Addition</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:18.1135%\">1.1.4-beta</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:23.2888%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maidaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🔗CurseForge</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:17.9518%\">v0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:40.5937%\">The Aether</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:18.1135%\">1.5.2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:23.2888%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🔗CurseForge</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:17.9518%\">v0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:40.5937%\">The Twilight Forest</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:18.1135%\">4.3.2508</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:23.2888%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🔗CurseForge</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:17.9518%\">v0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:40.5937%\">Touhou Little Maid</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:18.1135%\">1.4.6</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:23.2888%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/touhou-little-maid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🔗CurseForge</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;width:17.9518%\">v0.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>😎 特别感谢 😎</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Fogg05：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcozyui-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI+</a> 的原始作者，安息 2025</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>WhatDamon：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcozyui-ex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI Ex</a> 的作者</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>TartaricAcid：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/touhou-little-maid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Touhou Little Maid</a> 的作者</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>IBM：提供 <a href=\"https://github.com/IBM/plex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plex Sans 字体</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>MaokenFont：提供 <a href=\"https://github.com/maoken-fonts/frex-sans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frex Sans 字体</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Microsoft：提供 <a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluent Emoji</a>